BOX Micropolis

This is a MODIFIED VERSION of Micropolis.  The BOX's port changes and adds
to Micropolis as published at https://github.com/SimHacker/MicropolisCore
(commit 1e1e038).  The first commit of this repository holds the files taken
from there unchanged; the second holds the BOX's changes.  Each change to
the simulation is marked "BOX:" in the source.

